2683	    /// answer it. Blind pass 1 at aa00d41 (A08): matching on class and file
2684	    /// alone cleared an unrelated second claim in the same class and file —
2685	    /// R-001, written for "stage reads are leakage", silently cleared a
2686	    /// genuine untracked-chdir defect. A ruling answers a claim, not a
2687	    /// coordinate.
2688	    claim_requires: Vec<String>,
2689	    /// Phrases whose presence means this ruling does NOT answer the claim.
2690	    /// Blind pass 1 at 5fb1b57 (A08): a required phrase can be found inside a
2691	    /// sentence that negates it, so a ruling could suppress a defect it was
2692	    /// never shown. Required phrases say what a claim must be about;
2693	    /// excluded ones say what it must not be about.
2694	    claim_excludes: Vec<String>,
2695	    status: String,
2696	    file: String,
2697	}
