13320	/// Family 0 — source/CST/formatting. Metamorphic relations: **lossless
13321	/// emit** (the CST must reproduce its input byte-for-byte) and **format
13322	/// idempotence**, both compared over bytes rather than parsed values.
13323	fn case_source_cst(rng: &mut Rng) -> Result<Case> {
13324	    // Blind pass 1 at aa00d41 (A01): a formatter error became a Negative case
13325	    // whatever the category, so a formatter that lost support for nested or
13326	    // deep documents reclassified them as negatives and the run still reached
13327	    // its accepted target from the categories that still worked. Only the
13328	    // categories that DECLARE malformed input may be refused.
13329	    const REFUSABLE: [&str; 5] = [
