14228	/// The timings are returned SEPARATELY rather than embedded in the rows on
14229	/// purpose: the rows are the hashable artifact and must be a pure function of
14230	/// the seed and the code under test, while the timings are telemetry for the
14231	/// operator (M17.5 pass-2 #18).
