 9731	    // else in the gate required it to exist — so a tree with the corpus
 9732	    // deleted passed every corpus check vacuously while the packet went on
 9733	    // declaring `locked_acceptance_corpora_touched: false`. Twenty-three files
 9734	    // are tracked; absence is a broken tree, not an empty obligation.
