 9862	/// which, so this operator's reach is not lexically decidable, and pretending
 9863	/// otherwise is how P1-M047 came to declare a mutation no patch could
 9864	/// implement. The set is closed and shared with
 9865	/// `verify_mutant_operator_patch`: one statement of where the operator
 9866	/// applies, not two that can drift.
